WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:25.929
One fine day, a greedy dog took a walk.

2
00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:29.371
He saw something in the grass.

3
00:00:29.372 --> 00:00:36.619
"Oh! It's a bone! I love bones!" he said.

4
00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:43.782
"What a lucky day! Lucky day, lucky day!"

5
00:00:43.783 --> 00:00:51.667
"Hmm. How will I cook my new bone?" he said.

6
00:00:51.668 --> 00:00:54.985
"Will I smoke it? No!

7
00:00:54.986 --> 00:00:57.813
Will I boil it? No!

8
00:00:57.814 --> 00:01:03.695
Will I fry it? No way!

9
00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:08.946
I will eat it as it is.

10
00:01:08.947 --> 00:01:13.541
That is the best way to eat a delicious bone.

11
00:01:13.542 --> 00:01:20.282
Lu-lu la-la! Lu-lu la-la!" He danced.

12
00:01:20.283 --> 00:01:25.898
"Oh, what if another dog sees me?" he said.

13
00:01:25.899 --> 00:01:31.483
"No, I will not, I will not share my bone. It is all mine!

14
00:01:31.484 --> 00:01:35.152
Hmm, where can I hide my bone?"

15
00:01:35.153 --> 00:01:39.721
He looked around and quickly left the park.

16
00:01:39.722 --> 00:01:44.182
He ran and ran.

17
00:01:44.183 --> 00:01:47.312
Finally, he ran onto a bridge.

18
00:01:47.313 --> 00:01:51.699
"Whew! Now my bone is safe," he thought.

19
00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:54.886
The greedy dog was very tired.

20
00:01:54.887 --> 00:01:58.606
So he rested on the bridge.

21
00:01:58.607 --> 00:02:04.062
He looked down into the stream.

22
00:02:04.063 --> 00:02:09.460
"Hey! Who is that?" he thought.

23
00:02:09.461 --> 00:02:12.537
"That dog has a bone too.

24
00:02:12.538 --> 00:02:15.702
Hmm, his bone is bigger than mine.

25
00:02:15.703 --> 00:02:22.163
And his bone still has meat on it!"

26
00:02:22.164 --> 00:02:26.514
The greedy dog wanted the other bone too.

27
00:02:26.515 --> 00:02:32.874
"Woof! Woof! Give me that bone!" he said.

28
00:02:32.875 --> 00:02:38.976
"Oh, my bone! It is gone! Woof! Woof!"

29
00:02:38.977 --> 00:02:41.170
But it was too late.

30
00:02:41.171 --> 00:02:46.914
His bone fell into the deep stream.

